    "preamble": "Siba Sahu vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 24 January, 2024 Author: Sashikanta Mishra Bench: Sashikanta Mishra In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 410 of 2024 Siba Sahu .... Petitioner Mr. A.K.Dora, Advocate -Versus - State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Additional Standing Counsel Coram: Justice Sashikanta Mishra Order_ 24.01.2024 Order No. 1. This matter is taken up through hybrid mode.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. The petitioner is apprehending arrest in connection with Berhampur P.S. Case No. 609 of 2023 corresponding to G.R. Case No. 2178 of 2023 pending in the court of the learned JMFC, (R), Cog Berhampur for the alleged commission of offence under Sections 420/272/273 of IPC and read with Section 20 & 24 the Cigarettes and other Tobacco Products Act, 2003, 51/52/53 /58/57/59/63 of Food safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 103/104 of Trade Marks Act 1999.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
